<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                  xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL"
                  xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC"
                  xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:bioc="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn/biocolor/1.0"
                  id="Definitions_ASIS_Defect_AI_ClosedLoop"
                  targetNamespace="https://example.com/bpmn/asis-defect-ai-closed-loop"
                  exporter="OpenAI Codex"
                  exporterVersion="1.0">
  <bpmn:process id="Process_ASIS_Defect_AI_ClosedLoop" name="AS-IS 가설: 불량 분석 ~ Closed Loop 구축" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>순서도.png의 파란색 TO-BE 개선 대상 15개를 역산한 AS-IS 가설 모델이다. 시간은 1회 수행의 작업시간과 대기시간을 합산한 대표 Lead Time 가정치이며 1일은 8 업무시간으로 환산한다. 실제 현행 인터뷰, 시스템 로그, 리드타임 및 재작업률 측정으로 검증해야 한다. [B]=Bottleneck, [D]=Delay, [W]=Waste. ECRSA는 Eliminate, Combine, Rearrange, Simplify, Automate를 의미한다.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_ASIS_Main">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Defect_Definition" name="불량 분석 및 과제 정의">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>StartEvent_Process</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Defect_Receipt</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_PIC</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_Product_Info</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Defect_Factor_Analysis" name="불량 협의 인자 분석">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Physical_Analysis</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_Process_Analysis_Merge</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_PRA</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Production_Data" name="양산 데이터 확보">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Data_Acquisition</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_DPL</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_DBD</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_AI_Environment_Preprocessing" name="AI 구축 환경 준비 데이터 전처리">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_AI_Feasibility</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_Development_Environment_Merge</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_DEV</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_Preprocessing_Fork</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_OUT</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_LBL</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_Preprocessing_Join</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_DQC</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_Data_Quality</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_TDS</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_AI_Model_Development" name="AI 모델 설계 및 개발">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Model_Selection</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_DLG</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_MDA</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_MTR</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Test_Environment</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_Function_Merge</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_Function_Validation</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_CIM</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Parameter_Optimization</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Monitoring_Optimization" name="모니터링 및 이상감지 최적화">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_MON</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SubProcess_ASIS_ANO</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Defect_Conformity</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Closed_Loop</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>EndEvent_Process</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="StartEvent_Process" name="시작">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Start_To_Receipt</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_Defect_Receipt" name="불량 현상 접수">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_Start_To_Receipt</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Receipt_To_ASIS_PIC</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="SubProcess_ASIS_PIC" name="I01 제품 정보 확인 AS-IS">
      <bpmn:documentation>TO-BE 개선 대상 I01: 제품 정보 확인. AS-IS 가설: 제품·Lot 정보가 시스템과 문서에 흩어져 있고, 누락 정보 회신을 기다리는 상태. 가정 Lead Time: 6h → 30분 (92% 단축). ECRSA: C/S/A. 개선안: 접수 항목을 표준화하고 PLM·MES 정보를 통합 조회해 재요청과 수기 대조를 축소.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_Receipt_To_ASIS_PIC</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_PIC_To_Product_Info</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_ASIS_PIC">
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_PIC_01</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_PIC_01" name="메일·전화로 제품/Lot 정보 요청 [D] · 3h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Delay. 가정 Lead Time: 3h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_PIC_01</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_PIC_02</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_PIC_02" name="PLM·MES·문서별 정보 개별 조회 [B/W] · 1h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Bottleneck, Waste. 가정 Lead Time: 1h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_PIC_02</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_PIC_03</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_PIC_03" name="누락 정보 재요청·수기 대조 [B/D/W] · 2h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Bottleneck, Delay, Waste. 가정 Lead Time: 2h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_PIC_03</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_PIC_04</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="End_ASIS_PIC">
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_PIC_04</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_PIC_01" sourceRef="Start_ASIS_PIC" targetRef="Task_ASIS_PIC_01" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_PIC_02" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_PIC_01" targetRef="Task_ASIS_PIC_02" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_PIC_03" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_PIC_02" targetRef="Task_ASIS_PIC_03" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_PIC_04" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_PIC_03" targetRef="End_ASIS_PIC" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gateway_Product_Info" name="제품 정보 확인 결과" gatewayDirection="Diverging">
      <bpmn:documentation>AS-IS 확인 작업 뒤 정보 충분 여부를 판단한다. TO-BE 원본의 Yes/No 표기는 논리적 의미가 모호하여 정보 충분/추가 분석 필요로 해석했다.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_PIC_To_Product_Info</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Product_Info_To_Physical</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Product_Info_To_Process_Merge</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_Physical_Analysis" name="실물 분석 (eFA, pFA)">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_Product_Info_To_Physical</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Physical_To_Process_Merge</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gateway_Process_Analysis_Merge" name="공정 분석 진입 합류" gatewayDirection="Converging">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_Product_Info_To_Process_Merge</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_Physical_To_Process_Merge</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Process_Merge_To_ASIS_PRA</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="SubProcess_ASIS_PRA" name="I02 공정 분석 (Commonality) AS-IS">
      <bpmn:documentation>TO-BE 개선 대상 I02: 공정 분석 (Commonality). AS-IS 가설: 데이터 추출·결합과 공통성 판단이 소수 분석자와 Excel 작업에 집중된 상태. 가정 Lead Time: 24h → 8h (67% 단축). ECRSA: C/S/A. 개선안: 공통 Key와 분석 Template을 표준화하고 Commonality 집계·비교를 자동화.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_Process_Merge_To_ASIS_PRA</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_PRA_To_Data</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_ASIS_PRA">
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_PRA_01</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_PRA_01" name="공정·설비별 자료 추출 요청 [D] · 8h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Delay. 가정 Lead Time: 8h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_PRA_01</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_PRA_02</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_PRA_02" name="담당자별 Excel 수기 취합 [B/W] · 8h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Bottleneck, Waste. 가정 Lead Time: 8h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_PRA_02</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_PRA_03</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_PRA_03" name="Excel 공통조건 비교 [B/W] · 8h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Bottleneck, Waste. 가정 Lead Time: 8h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_PRA_03</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_PRA_04</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="End_ASIS_PRA">
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_PRA_04</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_PRA_01" sourceRef="Start_ASIS_PRA" targetRef="Task_ASIS_PRA_01" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_PRA_02" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_PRA_01" targetRef="Task_ASIS_PRA_02" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_PRA_03" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_PRA_02" targetRef="Task_ASIS_PRA_03" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_PRA_04" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_PRA_03" targetRef="End_ASIS_PRA" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_Data_Acquisition" name="Data 확보 및 검증">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_PRA_To_Data</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Data_To_ASIS_DPL</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="SubProcess_ASIS_DPL" name="I03 Data Pipeline 설계 AS-IS">
      <bpmn:documentation>TO-BE 개선 대상 I03: Data Pipeline 설계. AS-IS 가설: 자동 연계 없이 요청·파일 전달·수동 변환 주기로 데이터를 모으는 상태. 가정 Lead Time: 32h → 12h (63% 단축). ECRSA: E/C/R/A. 개선안: 추출 요청·메일 전달을 제거하고 수집을 앞단으로 재배열해 소스 결합·형식 변환을 자동화.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_Data_To_ASIS_DPL</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DPL_To_ASIS_DBD</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_ASIS_DPL">
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DPL_01</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_DPL_01" name="시스템별 CSV 개별 추출 요청 [B/D] · 16h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Bottleneck, Delay. 가정 Lead Time: 16h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_DPL_01</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DPL_02</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_DPL_02" name="이메일·공유폴더로 파일 전달 [D/W] · 4h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Delay, Waste. 가정 Lead Time: 4h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_DPL_02</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DPL_03</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_DPL_03" name="포맷 수동 변환·병합 [B/W] · 12h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Bottleneck, Waste. 가정 Lead Time: 12h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_DPL_03</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DPL_04</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="End_ASIS_DPL">
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_DPL_04</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_DPL_01" sourceRef="Start_ASIS_DPL" targetRef="Task_ASIS_DPL_01" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_DPL_02" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_DPL_01" targetRef="Task_ASIS_DPL_02" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_DPL_03" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_DPL_02" targetRef="Task_ASIS_DPL_03" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_DPL_04" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_DPL_03" targetRef="End_ASIS_DPL" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="SubProcess_ASIS_DBD" name="I04 DB 설계 AS-IS">
      <bpmn:documentation>TO-BE 개선 대상 I04: DB 설계. AS-IS 가설: 표준 스키마와 버전 관리 없이 개인·부서별 파일을 반복 가공하는 상태. 가정 Lead Time: 24h → 8h (67% 단축). ECRSA: C/S/A. 개선안: 분산 파일을 중앙 DB로 결합하고 스키마·Key·단위를 표준화.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_DPL_To_ASIS_DBD</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DBD_To_Feasibility</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_ASIS_DBD">
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DBD_01</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_DBD_01" name="개인 PC·부서 폴더별 저장 [W] · 2h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Waste. 가정 Lead Time: 2h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_DBD_01</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DBD_02</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_DBD_02" name="컬럼·키·단위를 개별 정의 [B/W] · 12h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Bottleneck, Waste. 가정 Lead Time: 12h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_DBD_02</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DBD_03</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="Task_ASIS_DBD_03" name="버전 확인·수동 Join·중복 제거 [D/W] · 10h">
        <bpmn:documentation>PI 이슈: Delay, Waste. 가정 Lead Time: 10h. 현장 확인 전 AS-IS 가설 단계.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_DBD_03</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DBD_04</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="End_ASIS_DBD">
        <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_DBD_04</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_DBD_01" sourceRef="Start_ASIS_DBD" targetRef="Task_ASIS_DBD_01" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_DBD_02" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_DBD_01" targetRef="Task_ASIS_DBD_02" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_DBD_03" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_DBD_02" targetRef="Task_ASIS_DBD_03" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_ASIS_DBD_04" sourceRef="Task_ASIS_DBD_03" targetRef="End_ASIS_DBD" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_AI_Feasibility" name="AI 적용 타당성 검토">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_ASIS_DBD_To_Feasibility</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Feasibility_To_Environment_Merge</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gateway_Development_Environment_Merge" name="환경 설정 진입 합류" gatewayDirection="Converging">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_Feasibility_To_Environment_Merge</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_Data_Quality_Rework</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Environment_Merge_To_ASIS_DEV</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="SubProcess_ASIS_DEV" name="I05 개발 환경 및 도구 설정 AS-IS">
      <bpmn:documentation>TO-BE 개선 대상 I05: 개발 환경 및 도구 설정. AS-IS 가설: 개인 PC마다 환경이 달라 설치·공유·재현 문제가 반복되는 상태. 가정 Lead Time: 8h → 30분 (94% 단축). ECRSA: E/S/A. 개선안: 개인별 설치와 이메일 코드 공유를 제거하고 서버·code-server 환경을 표준 제공.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_Environment_Merge_To_ASIS_DEV</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DEV_To_Preprocess_Fork</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_ASIS_DEV">
        <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_ASIS_DEV_01</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
